            "title": "Real Waterproof Gold, Always.",
            "info": "<p>With four layers of real 18-karat gold plating coating your water-resistant steel, you never have to worry about a lack of quality. Since we use hypoallergenic steel instead of silver like other brands, our jewelry is all water-proof & sweat-proof, proudly backed by a <strong>Lifetime Warranty</strong> so you never have to take it off. And just to be extra sure you're in love, every order comes with a 100-Day Moneyback Guarantee.</p>",
